cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this protocol or the derived statistics, please cite it as below."
title: "Matrix stiffness x neuropathic pain: prospectively specified reanalysis of GSE98547, GSE111216 and GSE261676"
abstract: >-
  A prospectively specified reanalysis testing whether the matrix-stiffness-responsive,
  YAP/TAZ-dependent transcriptional programme is activated in dorsal root ganglion and
  spinal cord after nerve injury or inflammation. The primary hypothesis is not supported:
  no module survives expression-matched nulls or BH correction, and a bounded
  sample-level observation in the opposite direction is reported with its limits.
